# Line endings, decided by the repository rather than by each contributor's
# `core.autocrlf`. Biome's formatter enforces LF; on Windows the default
# `core.autocrlf=true` would check every file out as CRLF and fail lint on a
# tree nobody has edited.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never converted, never diffed as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.mov binary
